# EMPIRE Stack Rules

## Banned technologies

- React, Next.js, Vue, Svelte, or any SPA framework
- Firebase, Supabase, or other cloud BaaS backends
- Paid cloud LLM APIs in application code
- Frontend build steps for the core UI
- Cloud deployment targets in runtime configuration

## Required stack

- Frontend: plain HTML + HTMX + Alpine.js via CDN only
- Backend: PocketBase at http://127.0.0.1:8090
- Inference: http://localhost:11434/v1 (Ollama)
- Memory: Cognee 1.0 remember/recall/improve/forget
- MCP: Python FastMCP in mcp/ registered in .cursor/mcp.json
- Eve agents only under agents/* with local Ollama provider

Do not instruct changing Cursor Base URL to Ollama during the build phase.
